# Keep the pages, diagrams and operator scripts out of every image built from this
# section folder: only the analyst's code, its fixtures and a sample's own src/ belong in
# one.
# policies/ is deliberately NOT excluded: the generated nono profiles go into the image,
# so a run can check that what the page shows is what the generator produces.
**/README.md
**/images/
**/scripts/
**/deploy/
**/iam/
**/.env
**/.env.example
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
